  message: "Closed in PR #3859 (commit d42c8b83bd). Three concrete gaps in WS linker fixed: (1) NATIVE_WEBSOCKET_TEMPLATE_PATTERN handles backtick template URLs with trailing literal path; (2) HAS_WEBSOCKET_CONSTRUCTOR + TS_TEMPLATE_URL_PATH_PATTERN handle function-extracted URL idiom (hypergumbo's own getWsUrl()/connect() pattern); (3) STARLETTE_WEBSOCKET_ROUTE recognizes Starlette's WebSocketRoute('/path', handler) form; (4) cross-language bridge logic emits edge_type='calls' + meta['protocol']='ws' + meta['cross_language'] following the HTTP linker convention (http.py:1511). Empirical: hypergumbo self-analysis 0 → 12 WS bridge edges; target edge typescript:.../ws-client.ts → websocket:.../serve.py:433:/ws:endpoint exists with server_framework='starlette' and cross_language=True. Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation per the Wave 6 entrypoint-coverage rule."  # 0237
